{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も\nアンダーライブでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございます(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の\n夜公演は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/10/13/0993498/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏と未央奈が来てくれてたよ＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安定の肩だしで来てた真夏さんの\n差し入れのプリン\nうまぺろだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/10/13/0993498/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しあわせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さりげなく\n肩から未央奈になってる未央奈さんは\nある曲の中田が可愛かった\nと言ってくれて嬉しかったな(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれて本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/10/13/0993498/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山場越えました！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この3日間\n体力面が不安で怖かったけど\nここを乗り越えられたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはもう体力面の心配はほぼないので\nクオリティ重視で頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の有吉反省会で\n大場さんにダンスが揃ってないと言われてしまって\n悔しかったので＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/10/13/0993498/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かに乃木坂って\nダンスほんと弱いし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと思ってた事だったから\nその通りすぎて\n痛感。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーからクオリティあげていけるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばります！＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村沙友理、中田花奈が乃木坂46「新曲MV秘話」「神宮ライブ裏側」を解説"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://news.dwango.jp/?itemid=11821"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"記事が\nあがりました～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブについても書いてるので\n良かったら読んでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/10/13/0993498/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}